    \"m_Title\": \"Star Brightness\",\n    \"m_Content\": \"Here we make use of a
    gradient noise and clamp its values within a range of 0 to 1. By then mulitplying
    this gradient with the stars we created we create the effect that some stars
    are brighter than others.\",\n    \"m_TextSize\": 0,\n    \"m_Theme\": 1,\n   
    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\": \"2\",\n        \"x\": -1555.0,\n       
